**CORPORATE LOAN AGREEMENT**

**January 14, 2021**

**1. AGREEMENT**

This Loan Agreement (the "Agreement") is entered into as of January 14, 2021, by and between Northbridge Capital Partners Limited, a limited partnership organized under the laws of the State of Delaware, with its principal place of business at 1234 Bank Street, New York, NY 10001 (the "Lender"), and the following subsidiaries of ABC Corporation, a Delaware corporation with its principal place of business at 5678 Capital Avenue, Chicago, IL 60601 (the "Borrowers"):

* XYZ Manufacturing Inc., a Delaware corporation
* ABC Services Ltd., a company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales
* DEF Operations Ireland Ltd., a company incorporated under the laws of Ireland

**2. LOAN TERMS**

2.1 The Lender has agreed to lend to the Borrowers the principal amount of $100,000,000 (the "Loan Amount") on the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement.

2.2 The Loan Amount shall be made available to the Borrowers in one or more tranches, as the Borrowers may request from time to time.

2.3 The Loan Amount shall be repayable in equal monthly installments over a period of 5 years, commencing on January 14, 2023.

**3. INTEREST AND FEES**

3.1 The Loan Amount shall bear interest at an annual rate of 4.5% (the "Interest Rate"), calculated on the basis of a 360-day year, and payable in arrears.

3.2 The Borrowers shall also pay all fees and expenses incurred by the Lender in connection with this Agreement, including, without limitation, legal fees, accounting fees, and expenses incurred in connection with the administration of this Agreement.

**4. DEFAULT AND REMEDIES**

4.1 If any Borrower fails to make any payment when due, or if any Borrower breaches any of its obligations under this Agreement, such Borrower shall be in default.

4.2 Upon the occurrence of any default, the Lender shall have the right to declare all amounts outstanding under this Agreement immediately due and payable.

4.3 In the event of default, the Lender shall have the right to exercise any and all remedies available to it under applicable law, including, without limitation, the right to foreclose on any collateral pledged by the Borrowers, to seize and sell any assets of the Borrowers, and to commence legal proceedings against the Borrowers.

**5. GOVERNING LAW**

This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware.

**6. MISCELLANEOUS**

6.1 This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the parties with respect to the subject matter hereof and supersedes all prior and contemporaneous negotiations, understandings, and agreements, whether written or oral.

6.2 This Agreement may not be amended except by a written instrument executed by both parties.

6.3 The waiver by either party of any default, breach, or condition of this Agreement by the other party shall not constitute a waiver of any subsequent default, breach, or condition.

6.4 If any provision of this Agreement is held to be invalid, illegal, or unenforceable in any respect, such provision shall be ineffective only to the extent of such invalidity, illegality, or unenforceability, and the remaining provisions of this Agreement shall remain in full force and effect.

**7. SIGNATURES**

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Agreement as of the date first above written.

